                <profile name="Architect of Titan" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" hidden="false" id="ba86-847e-9004-0835">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">If Janus is the army's Warlord, he and any unit he joins gain the Fearless and Preferred Enemy (Daemons) special rules. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during any phase of the opposing player's turn, as long as Janus has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
